{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\"issues\":[{\"sec\":\"S03\",\"screen\":\"那一刻的轻松是真的，却没带来答案。昂扬退潮后，又忍不住问：刚才是真的相信，还是只在努力相信\",\"source\":\"也可以听成：这股活动感也可以听成一次短暂的侧身离场……那一刻的轻松可以是真的，并非假装；只是它没有替心里的事找到答案。另一个听法是：如果换一种感受，这里不像重新获得活力，更像前一段的昂扬正在慢慢退潮……仿佛心里冒出一句自问：我刚才是真的相信那些话，还是只是在努力让自己相信？\",\"type\":\"7\",\"severity\":\"轻微\",\"why\":\"定稿将“短暂侧身离场”和“昂扬退潮”作为同一段音乐的两种不同听法，屏幕稿用“昂扬退潮后”将两种并列解释接成了先后发生的过程。\"}]}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "3b4e0bb3-109b-40bd-a85d-7a13aba7f6e1", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261109T083434183865Z", "elapsed_seconds": 251.797, "completed_utc": "2026-11-09T08:38:45.989083+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "cfb3aaf88d2baefa875cf881b2f200a63fa87ced8124f98ae0442dee301abfa1", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be50